{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Operation: Dahlia DLC is an expansion pack containing 5 all new missions, a <strong>new multiplayer lobby/social hub</strong> <i>(with basketball court and outdoor shooting range)</i>, new weapons, and an ample amount of new cosmetics dedicated to the LEO <i>(Law Enforcement Officer)</i>/SWAT theme.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >New Multiplayer Lobby/Social Hub</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855050/extras/c08db3e6b5e8c5e0eedcb8fa67cae01e.avif?t=1756969595\" data-has-big width=1560 height=300 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >5 New Missions:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gas Station</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855050/extras/4834bfc20bac45b66534c8c915586a35.avif?t=1756969595\" data-has-big width=1560 height=300 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ranch</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855050/extras/330760f53dcdb5a22ea2f68f10441916.avif?t=1756969595\" data-has-big width=1560 height=300 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Apartments</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855050/extras/1e6faef61a252db9fc037fa826ea4f95.avif?t=1756969595\" data-has-big width=1560 height=300 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Favela</strong> <i>(available Q4 2025)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855050/extras/7c2218030d814477cff382856f12e50e.avif?t=1756969595\" data-has-big width=1560 height=300 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Convention Center</strong> <i>(available end of Q1 2026)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855050/extras/743f03078a5367611b13ef3bbf26bbe6.avif?t=1756969595\" data-has-big width=1560 height=300 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in Mexico, these 5 new missions immerse players with a heavy emphasis on close-quarters combat. Take on the Los Craneos Rojos, a brutal cartel known for terrorizing and spreading their influence across the surrounding regions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eliminate the threat or switch up your ROE <i>(Rules of Engagement)</i> through the surrendering modifier. Test your PID <i>(Positive Identification)</i> with newly added civilians. Watch your step with newly added trip-wires. Los Craneos Rojos does not play.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >New Cosmetics:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New avatars and cosmetics expands character customization even further! Police labeled plate-carriers, kneepads, new helmets, LEO, Sheriff, SWAT and Hawaiian shirt variations all available for your role-play!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FAL Rifle,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >G45 Pistol,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SWAT Labeled Outfit Color,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Law Enforcement Officer Avatar,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sheriff Avatar,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Police-Labeled Plate Carriers,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2x Hawaiian Shirt Avatars,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New MICH Helmets with Goggles,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wolf Grey Outfit Color,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Styles of Kneepads,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More Coming December 2025 and March 2026 (Automatically Included)</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3855050?t=1756969595","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3855050?t=1756969595","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855050/3d40cce3d233148473cf43c9864eb7c3ddb2f6b6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756969595","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855050/3d40cce3d233148473cf43c9864eb7c3ddb2f6b6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756969595","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Operation: Dahlia DLC is an expansion pack containing 5 all new missions, a <strong>new multiplayer lobby/social hub</strong> <i>(with basketball court and outdoor shooting range)</i>, new weapons, and an ample amount of new cosmetics dedicated to the LEO <i>(Law Enforcement Officer)</i>/SWAT theme.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >New Multiplayer Lobby/Social Hub</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855050/extras/c08db3e6b5e8c5e0eedcb8fa67cae01e.avif?t=1756969595\" data-has-big width=1560 height=300 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >5 New Missions:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gas Station</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855050/extras/4834bfc20bac45b66534c8c915586a35.avif?t=1756969595\" data-has-big width=1560 height=300 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ranch</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855050/extras/330760f53dcdb5a22ea2f68f10441916.avif?t=1756969595\" data-has-big width=1560 height=300 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Apartments</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855050/extras/1e6faef61a252db9fc037fa826ea4f95.avif?t=1756969595\" data-has-big width=1560 height=300 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Favela</strong> <i>(available Q4 2025)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855050/extras/7c2218030d814477cff382856f12e50e.avif?t=1756969595\" data-has-big width=1560 height=300 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Convention Center</strong> <i>(available end of Q1 2026)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3855050/extras/743f03078a5367611b13ef3bbf26bbe6.avif?t=1756969595\" data-has-big width=1560 height=300 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in Mexico, these 5 new missions immerse players with a heavy emphasis on close-quarters combat. Take on the Los Craneos Rojos, a brutal cartel known for terrorizing and spreading their influence across the surrounding regions.</p><p class=\"bb_para